\newlabel{fig:comparative_trajectory}{{12}{35}{Uzbekistan versus Vietnam: Comparative Reform Trajectory. Three panels: (A)~Manufacturing VA (\%~GDP), (B)~FDI inflows (\%~GDP), (C)~Logistics Performance Index. X-axis = years since major liberalisation (year~0 = 2017 for Uzbekistan, 2007 WTO accession for Vietnam). The FDI gap (Panel~B) is the most dramatic divergence. Source: World Bank WDI}{figure.caption.14}{}}
